voxpupuli/controlrepo PR #202 on a public x86 server: evidence
===============================================================

Captured 2026-11-11, about 19:00 UTC, from the lab in hetzner/ of this
repo. The server is a disposable Hetzner Cloud cpx22 with the hostname
matrix01.voxpupu.li, applying roles::matrix_server from PR #202 at
commit 9aea5c8 with these names in place of the production ones:

  server_name    r1.voxlab.mikeharp.com
  matrix_domain  matrix.r1.voxlab.mikeharp.com

The server's address is replaced with <lab-ip>. Sections 1, 2, 3, 4
and 6 are command output captured for this file. Section 5 is counted
from the server's nginx and Synapse logs. Section 7 is what was
observed by hand.


