## Synapse ERROR lines since container start, per container
synapse-main: 0
synapse-worker1: 0
synapse-worker2: 0
synapse-worker3: 0
synapse-worker4: 0
synapse-events-persister: 0
synapse-receipts-writer: 0

The ten 502s are all between 18:52:40 and 18:54:18 UTC: an open Element
tab polling /sync and /versions while the stack was restarted twice to
apply the object storage settings. A change to homeserver.yaml, .env or
the compose file restarts every container, and the API is down for
about half a minute each time. The 400s and most of the 404s and 403s
are internet scanners and requests the server is meant to refuse.

The outbound count above starts at that restart. During the Element
session before it, the sender worker had delivered 17 transactions to
the other homeserver with no failures.


